# LaTeX build products. The sources, the figures and figure_data.json are all
# committed: the repository link in the abstract is load-bearing, and a reader
# has to be able to check a plotted number against its artefact without a build.
#
# The two output PDFs are not committed. `make` rebuilds them in seconds, and a
# committed PDF goes stale against its sources silently -- which is the exact
# failure mode this repository spends its provenance machinery avoiding.
main.pdf
supplement.pdf
*.aux
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
